QGC WPL 110
# ============================================================================
# RUNWAY AUTOLAND MISSION v8 - GENTLE APPROACH + TRICYCLE GEAR LANDING
# ============================================================================
#
# Retained historical mission from the v7 -> v8 landing-tuning cycle.
# Moved from config/ into missions/ so it lives with other waypoint missions.
#
# CHANGES FROM v7 (archive/runway_autoland_short_final_v7.waypoints):
#   - WP10: lowered from 1.5m to 1.0m (pre-flare altitude closer to ground)
#   - WP11: moved from 30m to 80m south of home, lowered to 1.0m
#           -> final segment now drops 1.0m over 80m = 0.7 deg glide (was 2.9 deg)
#   - WP12 NAV_LAND: unchanged
#
# WHY: v7 dropped 1.5m in last 30m -> violent nosedive at touchdown.
#      v8 gives 80m of gentle 0.7 deg descent -> smoother wheel contact.
#
# APPROACH PROFILE (v7 -> v8):
#   WP10: 1.5m @ 100m south -> 1.0m @ 100m south
#   WP11: 1.5m @  30m south -> 1.0m @  80m south
#   WP12: 0.0m @   0m (home) -> unchanged
#
# ============================================================================

# Home position (set at arming location)
0	1	0	16	0	0	0	0	-35.363262	149.165237	0	1

# WP1: TAKEOFF - climb to 50m
1	0	3	22	15.0	0	0	0	-35.363262	149.165237	50	1

# WP2: First cruise waypoint - 200m NORTH, 60m altitude
2	0	3	16	0	0	0	0	-35.361500	149.165237	60	1

# WP3: Second cruise waypoint - 250m EAST
3	0	3	16	0	0	0	0	-35.361500	149.168000	60	1

# WP4: Third cruise waypoint - turn back SOUTH
4	0	3	16	0	0	0	0	-35.364000	149.168000	60	1

# WP5: Far south - 800m south of home for approach alignment
5	0	3	16	0	0	0	0	-35.370500	149.165237	60	1

# WP6: LOITER_TO_ALT - Circle down to 10m altitude
# This ensures we're at EXACTLY 10m before starting final approach
6	0	3	31	1	60	0	0	-35.369500	149.165237	10	1

# DO_LAND_START marker - landing sequence begins here
7	0	3	189	0	0	0	0	0	0	0	1

# ============================================================================
# STAIRCASE DESCENT - Gentler final approach than v7
# ============================================================================

# WP8: Step 1 - 500m south at 4m altitude
# First descent from 10m to 4m (unchanged from v7)
8	0	3	16	0	0	0	0	-35.367754	149.165237	4	1

# WP9: Step 2 - 300m south at 2m altitude (unchanged from v7)
9	0	3	16	0	0	0	0	-35.365957	149.165237	2	1

# WP10: Step 3 - 100m south at 1.0m altitude
# v7 was 1.5m - lowered to reduce final drop to ground
10	0	3	16	0	0	0	0	-35.364160	149.165237	1.0	1

# WP11: Step 4 - 80m south at 1.0m altitude
# v7 was 30m @ 1.5m - moved further out + lowered
# This gives 80m to descend 1.0m = 0.7 deg glide angle (v7 was 2.9 deg)
11	0	3	16	0	0	0	0	-35.363982	149.165237	1.0	1

# WP12: NAV_LAND - touchdown zone
12	0	3	21	0	0	0	0	-35.363262	149.165237	0	1
